So far as I know, Cowan, John Hodges, Twery, Gary Burgess, Paul Francis 
O'Sullivan are likely to stay at my house among those likely to come; 
Hodges and Burgess and possibly Twery would have cars, which is a good 
thing since my car couldn't carry everyone.  Athelstan needs transportation 
to where ever from his home in Baltimore, if he comes.  Keith Lynch walks 
or bikes, and hence is limited if it is more than a few miles from my house 
or Tysons Corner.  There are usually at least a couple of people who come 
unannounced - last year it was Aruna and her husband; the prior year (I 
think) it was Nexus and friend, the year before it was Ethan and Jake.

Tommy Whitlock is actually closer to Herndon/Dulles than to my house, as is 
Dave Barton (I think).  Shawn/Alex are further.

